  <item>
    <title>37.汽车拉力赛又如何「生于此间」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6640464daf1e22bb15c88e1e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6640464daf1e22bb15c88e1e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 May 2024 04:32:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客再次邀请到我们的老朋友小花，分享她最近因故参加的一个活动。录制时间其实是临近过年的时候，所以节目里说去年如何如何，请观众自行瞎猜时间线，之所以春录夏更，都怪我这个拖拉大王。</span></p><span></span><p><span>人是复杂的，故事拥有更多叙事可能，是迷人的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里是「生于此间」。（罗夏）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期分工</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持：罗夏、老澈</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：小花</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：罗夏</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面设计：罗夏</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目引用音乐：片头——文野（Electronic operator）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Zaliva-D - 倒摇嘴-Dao Yao Zui</span></p><span></span><p><span>Zbigniew Preisner -To Love</span></p><span></span><p><span>FEET - ブラインドマン</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="271">00:04:31</a> 途径4个国家的汽车拉力赛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="836">00:13:56</a> 雨林穿越赛就是“给你开了卷，也很难考”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="951">00:15:51</a> 掉到坑里，车手也不放弃，就是要冲上某个坡！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">00:17:30</a> 路数才是专业用词！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">00:17:53</a> 你要说：“我是，领航员！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1306">00:21:46</a> 用云南话说就是雀神怪鸟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1900">00:31:40</a> 认真的车手和认真的领航员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2292">00:38:12</a> 告诉你的领航员，我想让她当我的女朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2362">00:39:22</a> 我要去找我的女朋友“小绿豆”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2743">00:45:43</a> 车被卡住，反而比出胜利的手势</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2914">00:48:34</a> 挡风玻璃都碎了，但是他大笑之后拍了一个短视频</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3011">00:50:11</a> 他竟是蓝天救援队队员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3876">01:04:36</a> 被劝退的孩子居然考了省联考的第一名</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4023">01:07:03</a> 没事别太正经</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4083">01:08:03</a> 他说他要来借指甲刀，你们要不要过来？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4466">01:14:26</a> 多听壳中茶话会</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpKol3BvgqmVsoFt__SMuwEJbMn1.m4a" length="149188726" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:17:17</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo6xVzTkw2zRcdz-EcIwBAaDz3Xo.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>37</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>36.我妈，沉迷起网络微短剧了！「闲话杂谈」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/661cf19148c40e2fb06ea002</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">661cf19148c40e2fb06ea002</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 15 Apr 2024 09:21:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我妈，于老师，一位80年代的中文系大学生，在出版行业奋战了40年的资深老编辑，最近这一年，她，她沉迷起微短剧了。（老澈）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期分工：</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持：老澈 罗夏</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：于老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：老澈</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面设计：老澈</span></p><span></span><p><span>引用音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头——文野（Electronic operator）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Nicolas Jaar - Time for Us</span></p><span></span><p><span>Roe Deers - Lazer In The Jungle (Original Mix)</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">00:02:21</a> 资深老编辑缘何沉迷短剧？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="542">00:09:02</a> 于老师的微短剧总印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1083">00:18:03</a> 虐恋剧：都是绿茶和偏执狂！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2247">00:37:27</a> 甜宠剧：充满了封建糟粕！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3238">00:53:58</a> 这些东西会影响我们的价值观吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4153">01:09:13</a> 关于穿越的方方面面大吐槽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4962">01:22:42</a> 俗套情节的解构与发展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5437">01:30:37</a> 什么是俗？大俗就是大雅！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgHtnvF-NPy4OMS4yh-I0PzVW9KD.m4a" length="98274994" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:41:16</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZobmVMMXFBMU8zOXhSdWt4OWlsZEdWa3JRUlMucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>36</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
