  <item>
    <title>35.三个学动画的，漫谈龙珠和鸟山明「闲话杂谈」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660994c91519139e4fc3462e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660994c91519139e4fc3462e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 31 Mar 2024 16:52:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>很惭愧，失踪账号终于回归了。今天的嘉宾分别是我们的老朋友——分镜师小日，以及首次做客壳中茶话会的旅日漫画家夕鸣。上个月惊闻鸟山明先生去世，就想着邀请两位朋友来聊聊。我们这三个动画专业毕业的同学，在成长道路上，或多或少都受到了老鸟的影响。（老澈）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期分工：</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持：老澈</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：夕鸣 小日</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：老澈</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面设计：老澈</span></p><span></span><p><span>引用音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>山本健司 - Dragon Soul~Orchestra ver.~</span></p><span></span><p><span>张娟 - 勇敢的少年</span></p><span></span><p><span>FIELD OF VIEW - Dandan心魅かれてく</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">00:01:23</a> 现役漫画家为何没能完整看完龙珠？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">00:13:22</a> 龙珠这东西只有男生才看？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1072">00:17:52</a> 分镜师小日的画画启蒙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1909">00:31:49</a> 小时候，我妈带我认识贝吉塔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2394">00:39:54</a> 战斗力通胀这个事儿是怎么来的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3392">00:56:32</a> 龙珠后面的那些字母都是啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4397">01:13:17</a> 作为游戏设定师的老鸟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4638">01:17:18</a> 龙珠里的那些人名梗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5426">01:30:26</a> 老鸟的画很色啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5834">01:37:14</a> 尾声：身处在文化之间的创作者</span></p><span></span><p><span>附：下图就是天津饭</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhdKBFk-Z4I36yXYIrhGyQBZctEx.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrDPcAHKyXWG_fqUVlJFbfeoqlyz.m4a" length="100964220" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:44:02</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZnZWM2Y1FLSW4zRUdWaVdqRVRtMlBmVzdxcDAucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>35</itunes:episode>
