  <item>
    <title>32.聊聊这俩“冰”与“火”「闲话杂谈」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6533f89c98b6450e1c9c31a4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6533f89c98b6450e1c9c31a4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 21 Oct 2023 16:13:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客给大家聊聊《火山挚恋》和《在西伯利亚森林中》两部电影。纪录片相关的选题，本来是有一点包袱，有时会担心自己说的不好。但转念一想，也不必纠结太多，我从来以热心观众自居，对所见所闻，所思所感，都怀揣着诚恳的念头。一旦开始，才有机会去修正坐标。（罗夏）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期分工：</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持：罗夏、老澈</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：罗夏</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面设计：老澈</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目引用音乐：片头——文野（Electronic operator）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Nicolas Godin - Volcano March (From "Fire of Love"_Score)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Nicolas Godin - Zaire 73 (From "Fire of Love"_Score)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">00:02:34</a>一对儿迷恋着火山的火山学家夫妇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="606">00:10:06</a>这部电影抓住了隐居的核心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="715">00:11:55</a>从个体的角度切入，讨论与自然的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="822">00:13:42</a>地球繁衍出人类就是为了让人类给它造塑料</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1004">00:16:44</a>冰块和岩浆的特写镜头，迷人之处在于抽象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">00:19:30</a>《火山挚恋》的节奏其实是非常轻快的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1356">00:22:36</a>有个人要掉下去了，持摄影机的人不能拉一把吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1546">00:25:46</a>对纪录片有一种深深的疑惑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1602">00:26:42</a>七十多岁的老祖母吃饭不上桌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1733">00:28:53</a>我们掌握了影像的话语权，他们是沉默的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1899">00:31:39</a>拍纪录片便宜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2074">00:34:34</a>分享一个纪录片的工作方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2190">00:36:30</a>要和群众打成一片！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2389">00:39:49</a>ta应该生气，ta有权利生气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2471">00:41:11</a>一个人能死在热爱的志业中，是多么令人羡慕啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2670">00:44:30</a>跑去寒冷森林中隐居的人依然在思考政府与革命的事</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltFLOYm7PF8cy5QRnbTefENSVsHQ.m4a" length="93690285" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z1d20xNGVVbG5lektfZXZfeGJkUG9HMEZ3bEcucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>32</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
