  <item>
    <title>31.这些都是道哥对传统武术的理解，与本播客无关「生于此间」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/650161cd6884ccbb19cca40b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">650161cd6884ccbb19cca40b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 Sep 2023 07:16:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，我是老澈。很抱歉鸽了这么久，我和夏君这阵子刚好都在忙各自的事，留给播客的时间有点少，非常感谢大家没有取关。终于把本该7月底上线的这一期给剪出来了，手里还有两期的素材没剪，这周还有一位嘉宾即将录制，希望接下来还是可以尽量保持双周更的规律。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期，极道食者老师再次做客壳中茶话会，作为一个自幼习武的人，道哥给我们分享了许多关于武术的见闻和感悟，非常得罪人，据他自己说，这一期他绝对不敢在朋友圈里分享。那么就让我们期待，有更多认识（以及希望认识）道哥的朋友可以听到这期节目吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期分工：</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持：老澈、罗夏</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：极道食者</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：老澈</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面设计：老澈</span></p><span></span><p><span>引用音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头——文野（Electronic operator）</span></p><span></span><p><span>林穆 - 谁是大英雄</span></p><span></span><p><span>罗文,甄妮 - 世间始终你好</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">00:01:27</a> 极道食者再次登场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">00:08:30</a> 试论一个道哥可以打倒几个老澈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="915">00:15:15</a> 由唐山事件，看街头格斗的策略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1155">00:19:15</a> 高手的武器就是跟咱们不一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1434">00:23:54</a> 中国最早学跆拳道的小孩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1608">00:26:48</a> 谁还不是在金庸的武侠世界中长大的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1953">00:32:33</a> 什么是内家拳？能让师父对掌传功吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3225">00:53:45</a> 传统武术里的阴招、门子、人情世故</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3558">00:59:18</a> 推手技术在抢结账中的实践运用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3934">01:05:34</a> 传功小师兄“悟到了更好的”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4527">01:15:27</a> 把这些全给你祛魅咯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5034">01:23:54</a> 海外比武种种：因为厉害，所以输了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5428">01:30:28</a> 道士前女友把我的元神送到天庭雷劈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5860">01:37:40</a> 尾声</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ll8pXBkMwaFzoJoLaHaArpQv8nIi.m4a" length="200246043" type="audio/mp4"/>
