  <item>
    <title>29.本想聊聊奇葩食物，谁知奇葩的是我们「生于此间」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64a2d889ec448b75fdb0130e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64a2d889ec448b75fdb0130e</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 03 Jul 2023 14:17:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>再次请来了我们的模范嘉宾小日。三个热衷饮食的人，刚好顺理成章地聊聊吃——不是聊美食，而是聊那些我们生命中无法接受的食物。没想到，聊着聊着，话题又拐到了非常奇怪的方向……</span></p><span></span><p><span>*本节目纯属瞎聊，涉及的相关知识难免有误，有懂的朋友欢迎来评论区不吝指正。也欢迎各位朋友在评论区分享自己讨厌的食物，大家一起吐槽（或互相伤害）！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期分工：</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持：罗夏、老澈</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：小日</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：老澈</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面设计：老澈</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头音乐：文野（Electronic operator）</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目引用音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Armik - Lovers in Madrid</span></p><span></span><p><span>DaSoul,Bnny - Move To The Rhythm (Original Mix)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:00:43</a> 缘起：当我的朋友们成为了朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="407">00:06:47</a> 折耳根，我们的一生之敌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1293">00:21:33</a> 到底是哪个北京人爱喝豆汁啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1766">00:29:26</a> 葱爆羊肉，吃的是葱还是羊肉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2149">00:35:49</a> 像水果的萝卜，和像萝卜的水果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2483">00:41:23</a> 宫保鸡丁之争，罗夏的内心地震</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3148">00:52:28</a> 无法与食物对视的老澈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3986">01:06:26</a> 生蒜还是熟蒜，这是一个问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4414">01:13:34</a> 不忍吃动物，那就…吃人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5495">01:31:35</a> 优质伴侣小日，为爱吃胡萝卜</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpc_pHjmSTzhlSJLtgKnYyd7ed6m.m4a" length="191837345" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:39:22</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZxMVh5bGlMd2lZSjlZbkJpaVZhM0VhRmk0V2YucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>29</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
