  <item>
    <title>28.信马游缰，书家修一的漫漫小路「生于此间」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64996b80d6cdb59728664a97</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64996b80d6cdb59728664a97</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 26 Jun 2023 10:42:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客，邀请了青年书画艺术家修一来做客，分享现阶段的个人感悟。修一是一个很有能量的人，他笃定自己所行的路、所做的事。这期播客对我来说是很大的鼓舞和激励。水波可以涟漪散开，点滴善念能汇集成大的正念。“我到为植种，我行花未开。岂无佳色在，留待后人来。”（罗夏）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期分工：</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持：罗夏、老澈</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：修一</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：罗夏</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面文字：修一</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面设计：罗夏</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目引用音乐：片头——文野（Electronic operator）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Gustavo Santaolalla - De Usuahia a la Quiaca</span></p><span></span><p><span>Electronic operator- yesterday simple loop</span></p><span></span><p><span>Nujabes - Reflection Eternal</span></p><span></span><p><span>Electronic operator-只是一种虚无</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ugress - Monument Dilution</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">00:01:50</a>很多人认为古代书法作品比较优秀，是一种尚古吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">00:07:30</a>修一说民间书法，说普通人的书法本性。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">00:11:35</a>其实播客的闪光点和趣味就在于聊天的自然展开。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1008">00:16:48</a>从“杀劲”很大变为坦然。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1115">00:18:35</a>我们如何看待波提切利。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1527">00:25:27</a>“入境，就是仙”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1612">00:26:52</a>瓶颈期可能是旋转式上升，是另一种成长。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1787">00:29:47</a>应该模仿方法论，而不是模仿方法。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1918">00:31:58</a>艺术家应该去关心时事政治，并做出回应吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2164">00:36:04</a>窦唯的音乐让严重失眠的我，睡着了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2295">00:38:15</a>写苏东坡的诗就豁达一些，写两句李白，豪情就上来了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2492">00:41:32</a> AI写字又如何？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2890">00:48:10</a>“寻门而入，破门而出。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2973">00:49:33</a>继续往内心走，走小路。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljb3KATmhXzcEGnzKWGd6I3bWYrQ.m4a" length="107420267" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:38</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZoOHIzU3NvLWdKVDIwa1JNWHFtbkE4RUtVRHEucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>28</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>27.怪奇夜的浪漫游荡「生于此间」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/648c6ee6e16019bcbce20494</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">648c6ee6e16019bcbce20494</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 16 Jun 2023 14:17:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾神棍老颜，是我的老师，一位才华横溢的创作者。我们见面不多，平时各忙各的，但是每当有了新的际遇与感悟，总要聚在一起聊一聊，在谈话中梳理自己，在困境中互相鼓励。</span></p><span></span><p><span>登高观天象，心存来时路。（罗夏）</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目录制于3月，到6月中旬才上架。本拖延症患者郑重地向听众鞠个躬！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期分工：</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持：罗夏、老澈</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：老颜</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：罗夏</span></p><span></span><p><span>图片来源：老颜</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面设计：罗夏</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目中推荐书籍：《太乙金华宗旨》《气功心法》（孔宪德）</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目中引用音乐：Daniel - green to blue (slowed + reverbed)</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Lively Ones - Surf Rider</span></p><span></span><p><span>颜仙森 - summertime</span></p><span></span><p><span>Daniel - dark snowy night</span></p><span></span><p><span>Justin Hurwitz - The Armstrongs</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="283">00:04:43</a> &nbsp;孤身探地洞、半夜拍屠宰的猛人罗夏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1357">00:22:37</a> &nbsp;关于龙、梦境与灵魂出体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2075">00:34:35</a> &nbsp;担心妈妈走夜路会怕，独自接她下班</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2383">00:39:43</a> &nbsp;半夜跟着导航开车，开到荒村大坑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2677">00:44:37</a> &nbsp;“牡丹花很邪气，不要养。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2989">00:49:49</a> &nbsp;梅花易数、穿墙术与冥想的奇妙反应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4029">01:07:09</a> &nbsp;环铁深渊，断掉的胶卷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4540">01:15:40</a> &nbsp;蒸肉饼与蚂蝗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4948">01:22:28</a> &nbsp;一个让老澈回暖的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5650">01:34:10</a> 浮游生物寄居的大型鱼骨，生与死的循环之地。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5596">01:33:16</a> &nbsp;改变老颜认知的山中奇遇</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgHbwZcZ9VAbkBlq6KcOZN9NHyWZ.m4a" length="229007199" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:58:38</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZzRHJpQzRDZFdTZGtQOHNkdXJ0ekp3cHlNY1cucG5n.png"/>
