  <item>
    <title>26.极道食者：身怀技能无数，每样都写着吃人！「生于此间」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/643cf9e6a79cc81470b99d19</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">643cf9e6a79cc81470b99d19</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Apr 2023 07:48:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，本期的生于此间栏目，我们邀请到了美食网红·穿搭博主·安装工人·脱口秀演员·绘画老师·美式摔跤选手·节目策划人·漫画家·武术修行者·小说作者·专业厨师·帮派分子（不是）——极道食者老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>（老澈：我们这儿装不下这么多人！）</span></p><span></span><p><span>按照网上解释，“极道”的本义是“放弃其他大道，专修其一，更易获得成就，达到高深的境界。” 然而道哥却反其道而行之，你看他这些年，哪条道也没放弃。道未必高，行未必深，能耐却修了一门一门又一门，这大概是极道之另一极了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期分工：</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持：老澈、罗夏</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：道哥（小X书：@极道食者）</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：老澈</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：老澈</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：文野（Electronic operator）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">00:02:30</a> 极道食者，堂堂登场！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="589">00:09:49</a> 社交媒体上的美食恶徒：一言不合就写故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">00:15:35</a> “老师，你杀过人吗？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1199">00:19:59</a> 刀头舔血，生死徘徊的城市建设者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1881">00:31:21</a> 立志做一个有味道的创作者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2441">00:40:41</a> 行侠仗义靠的是传统武术，以及视听语言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2772">00:46:12</a> 那个在课上教我们开膛的老师，徐皓峰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3363">00:56:03</a> 龙与地下城，我的剧作启蒙课</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3691">01:01:31</a> 去日本学了个叫作战略设计的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3883">01:04:43</a> 三大表演体系在美式摔跤中的运用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4667">01:17:47</a> 因为广场舞，到央视写起了科幻故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5286">01:28:06</a> 在加拿大开启美食博主之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5945">01:39:05</a> 把三盘菜写了五万字的中篇小说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6308">01:45:08</a> 累了，想要逃离美食博主的浮华生活了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6791">01:53:11</a> 点亮全部人生技能，就会遇到那个隐藏彩蛋</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsn4cgQQfCWZ5c-IW4G5p-Qdnqjs.m4a" length="235647588" type="audio/mp4"/>
