  <item>
    <title>24.再见外婆，我终于不再被鸡蛋噎到了「生于此间」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/640cce5e8be5d40013e0d207</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">640cce5e8be5d40013e0d207</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 11 Mar 2023 18:54:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>也许你也曾在深夜放纵暴食，你也有着漫长的情绪消化阶段。</span></p><span></span><p><span>既然存在，我以为自有道理。</span></p><span></span><p><span>想吃，就吃点吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客来自一位女性的自我觉察讲述。</span></p><span></span><p><span>建议佩戴耳机，建议深夜独自收听。（罗夏）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期分工：</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持：罗夏老澈 小克</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：木木</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：罗夏</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：老澈</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：文野（Electronic operator）</span></p><span></span><p><span>引用曲目：</span></p><span></span><p><span>S.E.N.S. - 悲情城市~Variation 1</span></p><span></span><p><span>Evan Fraser,Vir McCoy - Walk Into The Forest</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="317">00:5:17</a> 暴食的习惯导致45天长15斤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="507">00:08:27</a> 好羡慕那个可以细嚼慢咽的姐姐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">00:13:50</a> 一次吃6种外卖，我通过吃来消化情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1628">00:27:08</a> 我对食物的感觉：追溯童年与青春期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2285">00:38:05</a> 我的炸串“干爹”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2885">00:48:05</a> 鸡蛋之夜治愈了我的暴食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3561">00:59:21</a> 一次购买韩国辣酱的实践，我真的变了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4040">1:07:20</a> 外婆去世后还想和我做最后的告别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5160">1:26:00</a> 领悟后，我成功面对了一段关系</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhOrPCVmFhcBIghG8p886wPfgmq7.m4a" length="187093591" type="audio/mp4"/>
